p/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:40:      - 设箭头色 A=2，提示条是 [4, 8, 3]。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:50:      - 轨迹周期固定为 AABB，而不是任意模式；这样人类可以把规律归纳为“箭头色两格、当前循环色两格”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:58:      - `wall_cells = non-bg minus arrow_cells` 原本默认除箭头外都是墙；加入提示条后必须把 hint cells 排除。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:63:      - 提示条是多色 1x3，不能被误识别成箭头，也不能被当作墙参与反射。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:68:      - 先放箭头和提示条，再规划对角线路径和墙。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:75:      - 提示条紧贴箭头，颜色来源是局部且可配对的。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:81:      - 提示条固定在箭头后侧，不进入主要轨迹区域。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:82:      - 反射墙继续保持单色；提示条固定多色；箭头仍单色，三类对象角色分离。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:83:      - 箭头数量限制在 1-3，避免 18-20 的画布过于拥挤。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:87:      - A 永远是箭头色，来源固定。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:105:      - solver 假设每个真箭头都能唯一反推出一条完整提示条；generator 保证提示条全在网格内且不重叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:112:def _is_arrow_pts(pts: list[tuple[int, int]]) -> bool:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:120:def _arrow_dir_and_start(pts: list[tuple[int, int]]) -> tuple[tuple[int, int], tuple[int, int]] | None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:161:def _detect_arrows_and_cycles(g: np.ndarray, bg: int):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:163:    arrow_cells: set[tuple[int, int]] = set()\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:164:    raw_arrows: list[tuple[int, list[tuple[int, int]]]] = []\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:168:            if _is_arrow_pts(pts):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:169:                raw_arrows.append((int(col), pt